# Share shows only where the platform has a share sheet, and a press hands the clip to it:
# headless and Chromium on Linux have none, so the browser run gives the page one.
wait 'value="No share sheet"'
wait not '#share.button'
#web share-sheet
#web wait 'value="A share sheet"'
#web click '#share.button'
#web shared https://be3.example/invite
